+## 2026-10-04 - Independent Astra review handoff prepared
+
+The operator requested a complete, fresh security assessment of the inherited
+third-party code before continuation or modification. Created the dedicated
+handoff in `../local/prompts/astra-security-review-handoff.md` and provenance
+inventory in `../local/context/third-party-review-baseline.json`.
+
+The handoff covers all tracked files, source and lifecycle tracing, trust
+boundaries, C/Win32 memory and resource safety, configuration/persistence,
+monitor/input/media behavior, fatal reliability defects, build/CI/release
+inputs, history, docs and licensing. It requires evidence for strengths and
+flaws, separates uncertainty, and retains the supported-build/runtime gaps.
+
+The installed audit protocol permits writes to the report and audit ledgers
